+       The phandle and specifier for the GPIO that controls sensor reset.
+diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/ovti,ov8856.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/i2c/ovti,ov8856.yaml
